* NBV constrained by both datasheet rdif maxima and IR<=5e-08A at VR=16.8V; 5% guard. Local rdif<=30ohm at 0.005A, not an exact measured knee.
* SZ scenario: midpoint of datasheet range [18.4,22]mV/K at 0.005A. Not typical/measured; no tolerance sweep. TBV1 (Altium/PSpice relative 1/K) locally calibrated at 25C; linear extrapolation not a measured full-temperature curve.
* BZT52-B24 | Nexperia
* Source: Datasheets/Diodes/BZT52_B_Nexperia.pdf
* Revision: Rev. 2, 06-Feb-2024; B selection
* Datasheet-limit approximation at 25C. IS/N/RS fitted or assumed, not manufacturer model parameters. Single VF point: N assumed 2, RS=0. CJO converted from Cd using assumed VJ=1,M=0.5. TT omitted; trr is not TT. No validated switching, thermal or tolerance model. Nominal VZ and local rdif/SZ scenarios calibrated as detailed above; full knee/leakage not fitted.
